{
  "notes": "Built-in console commands (dvars and commands) of the 360 CoD games, written for this tool. Best effort: not every entry exists in every title update, and defaults vary a little between games. scope 'host' means it affects everyone in a match you host, so use private matches. cheat: true means it needs 'sv_cheats 1' in a match you host.",
